Hi {!Contact.FirstName},

I see that you have paid your enrollment deposit but have not yet signed up for classes at the University. I am checking in to see if you are still considering ASU and, if so, to encourage you to reach out to your academic advisor to arrange a time to sign up ASAP. You can find your advisor's contact information under the 'Advising' link on your 'My Programs and eAdvisor' section of your My ASU.

If you will not be attending ASU and would like to cancel your admission to the University, you can do so by following the instructions outlined at https://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions.

Let us know if you have any specific questions.